,["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and May to June came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, November to December came in at 44% of normal and May to June at 159%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, and grid 13665 fell to 58% of normal that year. On grid 13966, the preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 48.1, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
